  compiled into turing.turing_llama and turing-cpu only when built with TURING_BUILD_LLAMA=1.
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors. Licensed under the MIT License (third_party/llama.cpp/LICENSE).
  Turing Engine modifies it at configure time with third_party/patches/ (0001: BitNet-b1.58-2B-4T in its converter,
  gguf-py tensor mapping and src/models/bitnet.cpp).
  It bundles code under its own licenses: nlohmann/json (MIT, third_party/llama.cpp/licenses/LICENSE-jsonhpp),
  stb_image (public domain or MIT) and miniaudio (public domain or MIT-0) in libmtmd. On ARM, the build fetches ARM's
